1
00:00:00,975 --> 00:00:03,975
(Penny:)Smush, smush, smush.

2
00:00:04,353 --> 00:00:08,693
- You're hurting me.
- No, Sheldon hurt you.

3
00:00:08,858 --> 00:00:11,398
- Before. Now it's you.
- Oh.

4
00:00:12,987 --> 00:00:15,027
l think I understand.

5
00:00:15,531 --> 00:00:19,201
(Sheldon:)You're the one person who can say
Sheldon Cooper is your boyfriend.

6
00:00:19,368 --> 00:00:23,208
(Sheldon:)But that rings hollow if you can't
lord him over others in the flesh.

7
00:00:25,041 --> 00:00:29,541
l forget what I bring to the party
and what I take away when I leave.

8
00:00:30,129 --> 00:00:35,259
(Sheldon:)Please accept these valuable
Cooper Coupons...

9
00:00:37,011 --> 00:00:39,851
(Sheldon:)- ...as restitution.
- She doesn't want your stupid coupons...

10
00:00:40,014 --> 00:00:43,394
The Science Center? Redeeming. Let's go.

11
00:00:45,227 --> 00:00:49,277
(Sheldon:)Well played, Amy Farrah Fowler.
Let me get my coat.

12
00:00:50,649 --> 00:00:52,189
(Sheldon:)Oh, grow up, Leonard.

13
00:00:53,861 --> 00:00:56,151
(Raj:)Excuse me, I have something to say.

14
00:00:57,907 --> 00:01:02,037
(Raj:)None of you may realize it, but I was very
much looking forward to this weekend.

